+8. **Email / WhatsApp ΓåÆ Lead ingest** ΓÇö `NOT_AVAILABLE` (carry)
+9. **Owner / team / territory list scope filtering** ΓÇö `resolveCrmScope` still `mode: 'all'` stub
+10. **Prisma generate / db push on Windows** ΓÇö schema + SQL ready; apply when EPERM clears
+11. **Weighted Pipeline UI / reports** ΓÇö deferred to Phase 16
+12. **Rich UI hubs** ΓÇö many Demo surfaces remain thin stubs; APIs are live
+13. **AI scripts / answers / summaries** ΓÇö forbidden; not started
+
+## Exit readiness
+
+**READY_FOR_PHASE_15_WITH_BLOCKERS** ΓÇö Phase 14 Waves 1ΓÇô4 deliver a trustworthy Demo plane including delivery, source-backed attendance, recording governance, outcomes, Follow-Ups, Proposal/Trial handoff payloads, and honesty-gated reporting; external providers, Proposal/Trial/Tenant create, and rich UI remain explicit carry blockers.
